  "content": "\n\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/af67364e6961c7d301f6af56d97221dfb4206f09.png\" alt=\"Euphoria_Patches_Banner_By_Memokii\">\n</div>\n<br>\n<div style=\"display:flex;text-align:center\">\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=rgb(149, 74, 195)&labelColor=f091f6&color=rgb(4, 11, 20)&link=ttps://discord.gg/5N45SAsC3XF\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fchangelogs%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"Changelogs\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Changelogs-white?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=rgb(149, 74, 195)&labelColor=f091f6&color=rgb(4, 11, 20)&link=https://github.com/EuphoriaPatches/Changelogs\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"Euphoria Patches\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Euphoria Patches-050b14?style=for-the-badge&logo=googlechrome&logoColor=8d50bf&label=Official Website&labelColor=e797f3\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"Support\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/spaceagle17 - black?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&label=support&labelColor=black&color=f091f6\">\n    </a>\n</div>\n<h2><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/437130f3f10997f720ff0b788cb24cde3b3b8541.png\" alt=\"Euphoria_Patches_logo\" width=\"30\" height=\"auto\"> &nbsp; Complementary Shaders 附加组件</h2>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8e7b00cde9ddb9c5b8aa2132f65e46b634f3cb8c.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n</div>\n</a>\n<br>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Euphoria Patches</strong> 是一款专为 Complementary Shaders（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Reimagined</ins></a>/<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-unbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Unbound</ins></a>）开发的附加组件，由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flinktr.ee%252fSpacEagle17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SpacEagle17</a> 制作。  </li>\n<li>为 Complementary 增添了可选的精心定制功能。  </li>\n<li>所有选项默认均为关闭状态，但均可单独开启。<br>\n内置“常用设置”选项卡与预设配置文件，方便快速应用常见选项。</li>\n</ul>\n<strong>重要提示：使用本附加组件期间，请勿向 Emin 反馈 Bug，联系方式见下方。</strong>\n<h2>📥 安装方法：</h2>\n如果您不清楚如何安装 Euphoria Patches，请阅读以下说明：<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fhow-to-install\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>euphoriapatches.com/how-to-install/</ins></a></strong>！\n<h2>🔗 相关链接</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>Patreon</ins></a> 上支持 SpacEagle17，即可抢先体验预览版本！</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>官方网站</ins></a></strong> Euphoria Patches！</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fchangelogs%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>更新日志</ins></a></strong> Euphoria Patches！</li>\n<li><strong>联系方式：</strong> <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252fcontact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://euphoriapatches.com/contact</a></strong></li>\n<li>为 Euphoria Patches 添加 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fproperties%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>模组方块</ins></a></strong> 或 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252flang%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>翻译文件</ins></a></strong>！</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>❓ 常见问题</h2>\n还有其他问题？请访问常见问题页面：<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252ffaq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><ins>euphoriapatches.com/faq/</ins></a></strong>！\n<h2>Ember Host 赞助</h2>\n正在寻找性价比高且可靠的 Minecraft 服务器托管服务？Ember Host 提供超值优惠与顶级技术支持！\n点击横幅或在结账时使用优惠码 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EUPHORIA</a></strong>，首单立减 <strong>10%</strong>。此外，您的消费金额将有 <strong>50%</strong> 直接用于支持 Euphoria Patches！\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.euphoriapatches.com/assets/img/other/ember_host_ep.png\"></a>\n特别感谢 Complementary Shaders 的开发者 Emin 以及 Discord 上的所有测试人员！没有你们的参与，本项目根本无法完成！Euphoria Patches 鸣谢名单：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fcredits%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.euphoriapatches.com/credits/</a>  </a>",
